@US-001 @ui
Feature: Log in to School ERP
  As a School ERP user (admin, teacher, student or parent),
  I want to sign in with my email and password,
  so that I can reach the dashboard for my role.

  Background:
    Given I am on the login page

  Scenario Outline: Each demo user lands on their own dashboard
    When I log in as the "<role>" demo user
    Then I should land on the "<role>" dashboard

    Examples:
      | role    |
      | admin   |
      | teacher |
      | student |
      | parent  |

  Scenario: A wrong password is rejected
    When I log in with email "admin@example.com" and password "wrong-password"
    Then I should stay on the login page
    And I should see the error "These credentials do not match our records."

  Scenario: An unregistered email is rejected
    When I log in with email "nobody@example.com" and password "password"
    Then I should stay on the login page
    And I should see the error "These credentials do not match our records."

  Scenario: Submitting an empty form shows required-field errors
    When I log in with email "" and password ""
    Then I should stay on the login page
    And I should see the error "The email field is required."
    And I should see the error "The password field is required."
